{"id":"1c9d3a0ba202211c","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-random-walk-matrix.md","title":"归一化邻接与端口游走","display":"df-random-walk-matrix — 归一化邻接与端口游走","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-random-walk-matrix","aliases":["28-df-random-walk-matrix"],"display":"df-random-walk-matrix — 归一化邻接与端口游走","depends_on":["[[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]"],"source_book_location":"§21.1.1 and §21.3.1; printed pp.422–424,434; PDF pp.448–450,460","source_printed_pages":"422–424,434","source_pdf_pages":"448–450,460","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-random-walk-matrix"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-random-walk-matrix</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-random-walk-matrix — 归一化邻接与端口游走"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b6b8966305e02a9\" href=\"?note=0b6b8966305e02a9\" title=\"28-df-regular-rotation-graph\">28-df-regular-rotation-graph</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§21.1.1 and §21.3.1; printed pp.422–424,434; PDF pp.448–450,460"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"422–424,434"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"448–450,460"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\">\\(G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nbr}_G,m_G\">\\(\\operatorname{nbr}_G,m_G\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0b6b8966305e02a9\" href=\"?note=0b6b8966305e02a9\" title=\"28-df-regular-rotation-graph\">28-df-regular-rotation-graph</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z,w\\in\\mathbb R^N\">\\(z,w\\in\\mathbb R^N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\\in[N]\">\\(u,v\\in[N]\\)</span>；矩阵作用于列向量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_N\">\\(I_N\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 阶恒等矩阵。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[D]^*\">\\([D]^*\\)</span> 为有限端口字串集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in[D]^*\">\\(a\\in[D]^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[D]\">\\(i\\in[D]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 为空字串，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a^\\frown i\">\\(a^\\frown i\\)</span> 是在末尾附加端口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_G,J_N,u_N,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_N,\\|\\cdot\\|_{1,N},\\|\\cdot\\|_{2,N},\\operatorname{Walk}_G\">\\(P_G,J_N,u_N,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_N,\\|\\cdot\\|_{1,N},\\|\\cdot\\|_{2,N},\\operatorname{Walk}_G\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_G(u,v)\\coloneqq D^{-1}m_G(u,v),\\qquad u_N(v)\\coloneqq N^{-1},\\qquad J_N(u,v)\\coloneqq N^{-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_G(u,v)\\coloneqq D^{-1}m_G(u,v),\\qquad u_N(v)\\coloneqq N^{-1},\\qquad J_N(u,v)\\coloneqq N^{-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle z,w\\rangle_N\\coloneqq\\sum_{v=1}^N z(v)w(v),\\qquad \\|z\\|_{1,N}\\coloneqq\\sum_{v=1}^N|z(v)|,\\qquad \\|z\\|_{2,N}\\coloneqq\\sqrt{\\langle z,z\\rangle_N}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle z,w\\rangle_N\\coloneqq\\sum_{v=1}^N z(v)w(v),\\qquad \\|z\\|_{1,N}\\coloneqq\\sum_{v=1}^N|z(v)|,\\qquad \\|z\\|_{2,N}\\coloneqq\\sqrt{\\langle z,z\\rangle_N}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Walk}_G(v,\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq v,\\qquad \\operatorname{Walk}_G(v,a^\\frown i)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nbr}_G(\\operatorname{Walk}_G(v,a),i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Walk}_G(v,\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq v,\\qquad \\operatorname{Walk}_G(v,a^\\frown i)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nbr}_G(\\operatorname{Walk}_G(v,a),i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_G^\\mathsf T=P_G,\\qquad P_G(u,v)\\ge0,\\qquad\\sum_{u=1}^N P_G(u,v)=\\sum_{u=1}^N P_G(v,u)=1,\\qquad P_Gu_N=u_N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_G^\\mathsf T=P_G,\\qquad P_G(u,v)\\ge0,\\qquad\\sum_{u=1}^N P_G(u,v)=\\sum_{u=1}^N P_G(v,u)=1,\\qquad P_Gu_N=u_N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_G\">\\(P_G\\)</span> 是归一化邻接矩阵，即本书的 random-walk matrix；第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 列给出从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 取均匀端口后的终点分布。对称性和列和由旋转图节点推出，行和继而成立，故均匀分布平稳。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Walk}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{Walk}_G\\)</span> 按有限字串长度递归，每步的端点唯一且仍在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[N]\">\\([N]\\)</span>，涵盖零步游走。这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_N\">\\(u_N\\)</span> 是总质量为1的均匀列向量，而非常向量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1,\\ldots,1)\">\\((1,\\ldots,1)\\)</span>；所有范数绑定同一维数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-regular-rotation-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0b6b8966305e02a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-regular-rotation-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0b6b8966305e02a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$；$\\operatorname{nbr}_G,m_G$ 见 [[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]。$z,w\\in\\mathbb R^N$，$u,v\\in[N]$；矩阵作用于列向量；$I_N$ 为 $N$ 阶恒等矩阵。$[D]^*$ 为有限端口字串集合，$a\\in[D]^*$，$i\\in[D]$；$\\varepsilon$ 为空字串，$a^\\frown i$ 是在末尾附加端口 $i$。$P_G,J_N,u_N,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_N,\\|\\cdot\\|_{1,N},\\|\\cdot\\|_{2,N},\\operatorname{Walk}_G$ 由下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nbr}_G,m_G","display":false},{"tex":"z,w\\in\\mathbb R^N","display":false},{"tex":"u,v\\in[N]","display":false},{"tex":"I_N","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"[D]^*","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in[D]^*","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in[D]","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"a^\\frown i","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"P_G,J_N,u_N,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_N,\\|\\cdot\\|_{1,N},\\|\\cdot\\|_{2,N},\\operatorname{Walk}_G","display":false},{"tex":"P_G(u,v)\\coloneqq D^{-1}m_G(u,v),\\qquad u_N(v)\\coloneqq N^{-1},\\qquad J_N(u,v)\\coloneqq N^{-1}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle z,w\\rangle_N\\coloneqq\\sum_{v=1}^N z(v)w(v),\\qquad \\|z\\|_{1,N}\\coloneqq\\sum_{v=1}^N|z(v)|,\\qquad \\|z\\|_{2,N}\\coloneqq\\sqrt{\\langle z,z\\rangle_N}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Walk}_G(v,\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq v,\\qquad \\operatorname{Walk}_G(v,a^\\frown i)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nbr}_G(\\operatorname{Walk}_G(v,a),i).","display":true},{"tex":"P_G^\\mathsf T=P_G,\\qquad P_G(u,v)\\ge0,\\qquad\\sum_{u=1}^N P_G(u,v)=\\sum_{u=1}^N P_G(v,u)=1,\\qquad P_Gu_N=u_N.","display":true},{"tex":"P_G","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Walk}_G","display":false},{"tex":"[N]","display":false},{"tex":"u_N","display":false},{"tex":"(1,\\ldots,1)","display":false}],"bytes":2040,"backlinks":[{"id":"2ba6c7f35c1a7f30","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$ 采用 [[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]；$k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$v\\in[N]$，$\\vec i=(i_1,\\ldots,i_k)\\in[D]^k$。$\\operatorname{pidx}_{D,k}$ 为下式定义的端口编码；$v_t,j_t$ 依赖当前 $v,\\vec i$，按 $t$ 有限递归。$P_G$ 见 [[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]。"},{"id":"e714f65d9793749d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)$、$H=(M,d,S)$ 分别属于 $\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D},\\mathsf{RG}_{M,d}$，见 [[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]；$a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\operatorname{prodidx}_{a,b}$ 是下式构造的编号双射。$P_G,P_H$ 见 [[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]。$u\\in[N],v\\in[M],i\\in[D],j\\in[d]$；$R(u,i)=(u_R,i_R)$、$S(v,j)=(v_S,j_S)$。"},{"id":"f8284ae43439ae52","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$N,D,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$，$H=(D,d,S)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{D,d}$，见 [[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]。$[a]=\\{1,\\ldots,a\\}$；$u,u'\\in[N]$，$v,v'\\in[D]$，$i,i'\\in[d]$，$b\\in\\{0,1\\}$。\n$P_H$ 见 [[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]；$I_N$ 为 $N$ 阶单位矩阵，$\\otimes$ 为矩阵 Kronecker 积。$\\eta_D,\\zeta,R_\\circledR,\\widehat R$ 由下式定义，所有矩阵行、列均使用 $\\eta_D$ 编号。"},{"id":"df14955ee1f08cd3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$；矩阵和范数见 [[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]。$\\alpha\\in[0,1)$；$\\mathcal G=(G_N)_{N\\ge1}$ 为 $\\mathsf{RG}$ 中的图序列。$\\lambda(G)$ 是绝对谱参数，$\\operatorname{SpecExp}(G;\\alpha)$ 和 $\\operatorname{ExpFamily}(\\mathcal G)$ 是下式引入的谓词。上确界在 $\\mathbb R$ 中取值。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-260","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第21章：扩展图、游走与提取器：[[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]、[[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]、[[28-df-spectral-expander]]、[[28-df-edge-expander]]、[[28-df-explicit-expander-family]]、[[28-thm-random-walk-mixing]]、[[28-thm-expander-mixing-lemma]]、[[28-thm-spectral-implies-edge-expansion]]、[[28-thm-lazy-walk-spectrum]]、[[28-thm-expander-walk-extractor]]。"}],"outgoing":["0b6b8966305e02a9"]}